"name": "Ovintiv Inc",
"description": "Ovintiv, Inc. engages in the production and development of oil, natural gas liquids and natural gas producing plays. The firm operates through the following segments: Canadian Operations and USA Operations. The Canadian Operations segment includes the exploration for, development of, and production of oil, NGLs, natural gas and other related activities within Canada. The USA Operations segment includes the exploration for, development of, and production of oil, NGLs, natural gas and other related activities within the United States. The company was founded in 1881 and is headquartered in Denver, CO.",
